cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SOLIDIFY: A Real-Time, Browser-Based WebGPU Phase-Field Solidification Instrument"
message: "If you use SOLIDIFY in teaching, benchmarks, or research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
