abstract: >-
  SOLIDIFY is a zero-install, browser-native WebGPU phase-field laboratory for
  real-time 2D and 3D (up to 192^3 voxels) dendritic solidification, dilute-alloy
  microsegregation, 2D binary lamellar eutectic growth (Folch-Plapp / Jackson-Hunt),
  2D/3D Cahn-Hilliard spinodal decomposition (NIST PFHub Benchmark 1a), foundry
  casting thermal analysis, and Arrhenius-coupled solid-state heat treatment with
  precipitation age-hardening. It pairs a unified three-engine workspace
  (SOLIDIFY, EUTECTIC, SPINODAL) with a 118-element periodic alloy composer backed
  by cited binary invariants, nine auto-verified Guided Labs, and an automated
  verification suite.
